{"seq":4,"slug":"lc0070-climbing-stairs","title":"LeetCode 70 爬楼梯","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-dp/lc0070-climbing-stairs","wordCount":849,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-70-爬楼梯\">LeetCode 70 爬楼梯</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>假设你正在爬楼梯。需要 n 阶你才能到达楼顶。每次你可以爬 1 或 2 个台阶。你有多少种不同的方法可以爬到楼顶？</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>1 ≤ n ≤ 45</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：n = 2 输出：2 解释：有两种方法：1 阶 + 1 阶；2 阶。</p>\n<p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：n = 3 输出：3 解释：有三种方法：1 阶 + 1 阶 + 1 阶；1 阶 + 2 阶；2 阶 + 1 阶。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题是动态规划最经典的入门题，其本质就是<strong>斐波那契数列</strong>。</p>\n<p>到达第 n 阶只有两种方式：从第 <code>n-1</code> 阶爬 1 步，或从第 <code>n-2</code> 阶爬 2 步。因此方法数满足递推关系：<code>f(n) = f(n-1) + f(n-2)</code>，这正是斐波那契数列的定义。</p>\n<p><strong>暴力递归</strong>：直接按 <code>f(n) = f(n-1) + f(n-2)</code> 递归，存在大量重复计算，时间复杂度 O(2ⁿ)。</p>\n<p><strong>记忆化搜索</strong>：用数组缓存已计算的结果，避免重复计算，时间复杂度 O(n)，空间 O(n)。</p>\n<p><strong>动态规划（迭代）</strong>：自底向上计算，只需要前两个状态，空间优化到 O(1)。</p>\n<p><strong>矩阵快速幂</strong>：利用矩阵乘法加速递推，时间复杂度 O(log n)，适用于 n 极大的情况。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力递归</td>\n<td>O(2ⁿ)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>仅用于理解问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>记忆化搜索</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>自顶向下 DP</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迭代 DP</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>最实用的解法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>矩阵快速幂</td>\n<td>O(log n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>n 极大时使用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>迭代 DP（最优解）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function climbStairs(n: number): number {&#10;  if (n &lt;= 2) return n;&#10;&#10;  let prev2 = 1;&#10;  let prev1 = 2;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 3; i &lt;= n; i++) {&#10;    const current = prev1 + prev2;&#10;    prev2 = prev1;&#10;    prev1 = current;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return prev1;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> climbStairs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> current</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prev2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    prev1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>代码逻辑详解：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>prev2</code> 对应 <code>f(i-2)</code>，初始为 <code>f(1) = 1</code></li>\n<li><code>prev1</code> 对应 <code>f(i-1)</code>，初始为 <code>f(2) = 2</code></li>\n<li>每次循环计算 <code>current = prev1 + prev2</code>，然后滚动更新两个变量</li>\n</ul>\n<p>只需要保存前两个状态，空间复杂度 O(1)。这是&quot;滚动数组&quot;思想的最简形式。</p>\n<p><strong>记忆化搜索版本：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function climbStairsMemo(n: number): number {&#10;  const memo = new Map&lt;number, number&gt;();&#10;&#10;  const dp = (k: number): number =&gt; {&#10;    if (k &lt;= 2) return k;&#10;    if (memo.has(k)) return memo.get(k)!;&#10;&#10;    const result = dp(k - 1) + dp(k - 2);&#10;    memo.set(k, result);&#10;    return result;&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  return dp(n);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> climbStairsMemo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> memo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (memo.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(k)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> memo.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(k)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    memo.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(k, result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(n);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>记忆化搜索是&quot;自顶向下&quot;的 DP，与迭代版本的&quot;自底向上&quot;在计算结果上完全一致。区别在于：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>记忆化搜索按需计算，只计算实际需要的子问题</li>\n<li>迭代 DP 按顺序计算所有子问题</li>\n<li>对于本题，两者效率相同，但迭代版本代码更简洁</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>斐波那契数列的直觉理解：</strong></p>\n<p>可以用排列组合来理解：将 n 阶楼梯的爬法看作一个序列，序列中每个元素是 1 或 2（代表每步爬几阶），所有元素之和为 n。这个问题等价于&quot;用 1 和 2 组成和为 n 的有序划分数&quot;，其结果恰好是斐波那契数列。</p>\n<p>例如 n=4：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>全是 1：(1,1,1,1) → 1 种</li>\n<li>有一个 2：(2,1,1), (1,2,1), (1,1,2) → 3 种</li>\n<li>有两个 2：(2,2) → 1 种</li>\n<li>共 5 种 = f(4) = f(3) + f(2) = 3 + 2 = 5</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>迭代 DP</th>\n<th>记忆化搜索</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>每个状态计算一次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>迭代只用两个变量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>本题虽然简单，但蕴含了 DP 的核心思想：<strong>最优子结构</strong>（到达第 n 阶的方法由到达第 n-1 和 n-2 阶决定）和<strong>重叠子问题</strong>（递归树中存在大量重复计算）。这两个性质是使用 DP 的前提条件。掌握本题后，可以直接推广到 LC #746（使用最小花费爬楼梯）和更复杂的线性 DP 问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 70 爬楼梯","id":"leetcode-70-爬楼梯"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 64 最小路径和","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-dp/lc0064-minimum-path-sum"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 139 单词拆分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-dp/lc0139-word-break"}}